<description>&lt;p&gt;Sudanese armed forces have continued drone strikes on markets in the disputed Abyei border region, killing more than 150 people in each attack. Communal clashes persist, with SSPDF and SPLA-IO forces fighting in Kapoeta North, Eastern Equatoria, and in Wij-Panyikang, Upper Nile, while a separate ambush killed two people in Kajo-Keji County. Monitors warned of rising violence ahead of December elections and reported 40,000 people displaced by renewed Upper Nile fighting. The UCDP recorded two battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxQZHdPdHJvbUlsMVFnY29MWXpHZHZJQjN6dXRoVW5vVmp0Qng5ZjItd25wZ014Y29EMGFOWDY1b1JWdV9lRTcyS21leHVzNUQ3aTRDMU5wLTlqUXhoYXRuTkNjZUVVTjF1dFYyMzNLM0tieU9VNWhVUzJILTdWT3MzQ3VUc3Y5cGkxVjhpN3hXcGZielpTU0xITVo4eVpnRUU?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifEFVX3lxTE5DYlFuZ2xsR2xmVFkxVHA3bzh2UWpaU0ZuTHpoQXRrVnc5a3ZqNlpQMy12cDJWX3FHUG1Kd0R1am1qaGR1S2hoTXRPdzhQRmR4X0xVVFNwbGFUR2k0dGsybGZKdWgzNEtZVTV3QXhyZHdsdWt0UTQ3OTIzX2Q?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxPbG1vU0U0WS1EdmRtWE1Jd3ZfRC1kT3lwSW11NGQzelFIUWI2NURkT2VKaGtsZnEyWE94N1hiR3RfQThQbDhxb3hna19HRlhGUkVpOU5GRi1RZDBwekx1X2pnRnVRa2VCSEU3Q1ZWZUdudXBlUEU5ZUlDdW5RNENmY3ZKZ0xUUlZfX1J5c1EydXpjSzktdjgzZWl1dFMwaERqQ0d3bHhvbEwtNnZRWVZiQW4xTGMxQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sky News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxNVVRSM3dyWk9CNTlUcUJIemVkUGlYTGt4MUE2eTJCaDBXX2I4NGY2WUVsbDIySWdpSWcycVNXSXVVUzdEMnYyb2kzT3daTVRfdHh5S2tCbnpQVGJsUHVlRXh0MHdhMkVwcXE1M1AtSGFvZWtkTkNTcGRhTEhlcEhORW5PeC0zOGRCSVNJTEI2UWJsWXRrblBUbUE0Y2dYYjNfTl9EcE9iMjlLajFQOXR